    "body": "Honestly, I'm tempted to remove this field entirely. I chose this path as the slightly-less-nuclear option.\r\n\r\nYes we use the segment name, but only as a temporary value as we create the segment - we don't actually gain anything by holding a copy of the name. We don't even `#[derive(Debug)]`.\r\n\r\nRight now we're incurring the cost of a memory allocation and copy for no benefit.",
