    "body": "Best as I can tell, the only place where we log module name is here: https://github.com/starship/starship/blob/37b5168bfeb4e69c1439c1e5ef95ecb14cf7f82c/src/print.rs#L62\r\n\r\nAnd that is a string from the config file, rather than anything we store on the struct.\r\n\r\n`Module` doesn't `#[derive(Debug)]`, so I can't see any other way it would be useful.",
