    "body": "I was referring to the source-level info that comes from pretty_env_logger, e.g.\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/4605384/64831944-7faaea00-d59d-11e9-92d5-006f1473d87a.png)\r\n\r\nBut after taking another look, it would seem that the macro is actually deriving the (Rust) module path and using that as the source, instead of reading out of the (starship) module name. My mistake.",
